{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歷年有唔少高顏值女藝人以TVB女僕打扮亮相，以下就為大家盤點8大勁養眼造型！一齊睇睇！ 吳若希《奔跑吧！勇敢女 …</p><p></p>\n<p>歷年有唔少高顏值女藝人以TVB女僕打扮亮相，以下就為大家盤點8大勁養眼造型！一齊睇睇！\n</p>\n<h2>吳若希《奔跑吧！勇敢女人們》女僕冧老公</h2>\n<p>吳若希做戲好有喜感，今次化身女僕，似係搞笑多過性感！亦憑《奔跑吧》女僕Look拎「亞洲區最佳喜劇演員」獎。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/photo_6073168479525126118_y_10666098156789d94f387f4-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/photo_6073168479525126118_y_10666098156789d94f387f4-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/25312d7b-a2a4-495a-a524-a918488a8352_12489053686789dfea70d05-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/25312d7b-a2a4-495a-a524-a918488a8352_12489053686789dfea70d05-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>奪命提示｜劉穎鏇郭柏妍組女團勁煞食！</h2>\n<p>《奪命提示》劉穎鏇（Tiffany）同郭柏妍將組成女團「Double C」深入娛樂公司查案，談到Double C造型，郭柏妍接受訪問時透露每個造型及髮型都是花盡心思：「監製阿Jazz真係好好、好仔細，希望將每個造型都做到最好畀觀眾睇，所以每個造型同髮型都真係諗咗同試咗好多次。」談到造型改了又改，會否與拍打戲拍到瘦有關，郭柏妍坦言拍《奪命提示》確實愈拍愈瘦：「因為呢套劇真係好多動作場面，加上要配合番啲造型、想出嚟效果靚啲，我都真係唔敢食太多，我估呢套劇我前後瘦咗八磅左右，腰圍可能得番21/22吋，有機會比我選港姐嗰時仲瘦。」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-005_202846251067f351b9688d2-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 郭柏妍將與劉穎鏇組成女團Double C上陣查案。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-005_202846251067f351b9688d2-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>郭柏妍將與劉穎鏇組成女團Double C上陣查案。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-007-1_212864116167f352256d9a2-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 2人更會以露腰女僕裝及戴貓耳頭箍上陣。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-007-1_212864116167f352256d9a2-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2人更會以露腰女僕裝及戴貓耳頭箍上陣。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-014_42096548167f3529564c10-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 仲有大派心心跳舞嘅畫面！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-014_42096548167f3529564c10-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>仲有大派心心跳舞嘅畫面！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-003_98527725867f351bf828b9-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vs-youtube-tvb-003_98527725867f351bf828b9-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/d98fe076-1652-4c4e-9df4-d985ef6f18a8_69542623767f6248fc9467-1024x1537.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：大會提供）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1441\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/d98fe076-1652-4c4e-9df4-d985ef6f18a8_69542623767f6248fc9467-1024x1537.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>葉蒨文「tvb最索女藝員」女僕眼鏡娘</h2>\n<p>葉蒨文被封為「愛回家Candy可能係tvb最索嘅女藝員…」、「後生版楊卓娜」！2021年，葉蒨文分享了她在《堅離地愛堅離地》中扮演女僕的照片，網民紛紛讚賞她可愛！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/sophieysm_1732184121_3506136989068880801_22458690_1691057403673ffa614a8dc-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 世界級福利！（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/sophieysm_1732184121_3506136989068880801_22458690_1691057403673ffa614a8dc-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>世界級福利！（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/7x0z5ry8dzruvrjyyiqt9powtj0-kmprun3dblp9w2w_10760934776789d46be47ad-1024x1280.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/7x0z5ry8dzruvrjyyiqt9powtj0-kmprun3dblp9w2w_10760934776789d46be47ad-1024x1280.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sophieysm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>戴祖儀「長腿女神」女僕look</h2>\n<p>今年29歲的戴祖儀可說是近年被力捧的女演員，更加係數一數二嘅「長腿女神」，戴祖儀亦曾在綜藝節目《粵講粵㜺鬼》中也扮過女僕！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/rysj8_ai8iqsqniwnv3wywbhz1jcemnnj014kidneco_14564640546789db5c81e84-1024x1280.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：IG@joeythyeel）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/rysj8_ai8iqsqniwnv3wywbhz1jcemnnj014kidneco_14564640546789db5c81e84-1024x1280.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyeel）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳瀅巔峰期女僕look</h2>\n<p>陳瀅拍攝《全職沒女》身形keep住fit到漏，曾經以女僕裝示人，大騷事業線，顏值狀態更在巔峰期！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/-2025-01-17-12.33.05_9584717136789ddb072cc7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：see see TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"893\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/-2025-01-17-12.33.05_9584717136789ddb072cc7.png\" width=\"800\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：see see TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/-2025-01-17-12.33.17_11523343136789ddb40fa5e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：see see TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"845\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/-2025-01-17-12.33.17_11523343136789ddb40fa5e.png\" width=\"700\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：see see TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>江嘉敏</h2>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/photo_6073168479525126121_y_899059716789ddd9e71a5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/photo_6073168479525126121_y_899059716789ddd9e71a5.jpg\" width=\"851\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳曉華</h2>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/photo_6073168479525126122_y_8434960536789ddfb12571-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：陳曉華IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/photo_6073168479525126122_y_8434960536789ddfb12571-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：陳曉華IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>郭柏妍《下流上車族》為妹跳女僕舞</h2>\n<p>《下流上車族》第七集劇情講述郭柏妍因為送外賣而撞破妹妹羅毓儀在女僕餐廳當侍應，但因為羅毓儀笨手笨腳摔壞碗碟，而被老闆娘孫慧雪辭退。在計算薪金的時候，郭柏妍得知孫慧雪欠缺人手於是自薦自己，並且勸阻孫慧雪辭退羅毓儀，並以「魔法女僕姐妹花，魔法會翻倍，客人也會翻倍」為由成功說服孫慧雪重新招聘二人成為員工。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/uzilhnrlbeiu9oigjbhntulgt4r4dczp3r3yzd0d8s0_10787795986789de9bb3ec1-1024x1820.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 女僕 （圖片來源：郭柏妍IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1706\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/uzilhnrlbeiu9oigjbhntulgt4r4dczp3r3yzd0d8s0_10787795986789de9bb3ec1-1024x1820.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：郭柏妍IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e8%8b%a5%e5%b8%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳若希</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e5%83%95/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女僕</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%b4%e7%a5%96%e5%84%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戴祖儀</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB、IG@sophieysm、IG@joeythyeel、see see TVB、江嘉敏IG、陳曉華IG、郭柏妍IG資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/2552148\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:16.082604+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1531,"images":15,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:19:18.382273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:19:18.382273+00:00","content_hash":"7b7c589b7ae60b114d9523a03a573401e44862229dd2f6fab547a120de9b7b74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}